# Do
- Keep diffs minimal and focused.
- Work only under /apps/web/app and /apps/web/src unless explicitly asked.

# Don’t
- Do not touch: .env*, node_modules, .next, dist, .vercel, work-local/.
- Do not mass-rename or mass-delete without explicit instruction.

# Notes
- For ESLint/Prettier, use apps/web config only.
- Use WSL terminal; avoid PowerShell.
